  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# Feed the Swarm: \"Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal\n# to that permanent's mana value.\"\n# Sentence 1 is the compiler's DESTROY (B11-destroy-np), kept. Sentence 2 is M21 Niambi, Esteemed\n# Speaker's \"you gain life equal to that creature's mana value\" (QProp('target', MANA_VALUE)) as a\n# LOSE_LIFE of you. It is not gated on the destruction: an indestructible target still costs its\n# mana value (the card's ruling); an illegal target stops the whole spell.\ndestroy = compiled[0].effect\nlose = A(Verb.LOSE_LIFE, {\n    'amount': QProp(referent='target', field=QPropField.MANA_VALUE),\n    'controller': ControllerRef.YOU,\n})\nabilities = [SpellAbility(kind=SpellKind.SORCERY, effect=Seq(steps=(destroy, lose)))]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "You lose life equal to that permanent's mana value.",
    "ir": "abilities[0].effect.steps[1]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "The compiler's DESTROY is kept; 'You lose life equal to that permanent's mana value.' is M21 Niambi's QProp('target', MANA_VALUE) as LOSE_LIFE of you, not gated on the destruction (the card's ruling: an indestructible target still costs its mana value). G1 reads the mana value after the destruction (opp_giant: 5, the enchantment: 2)."
 },
